    ``count`` and ``mean``), then ``tolerance``, then the grid
    relations. Type mismatches (including bool) raise ``TypeError``,
    all other constraint errors raise ``ValueError``. Errors are
    prefixed with ``"fine: "``/``"coarse: "`` and
